Code + Dockerfile
Code Scan : CQA (Code Quality Analysis) ---> Sonar   
Build : Maven     (cp -r target Docker-app)
Artifact : Nexus
Dockerfiles ---> Build ---> image    ---(docker build -t appimage Docker-app) && (docker build -t dbimage Docker-db)
Image Scan -----> Trivy      ---trivy image imagename ( trivy name appimage & & trivy image dbimage
Registry ---> Push  
    Registry ---> Push

a. docker tag dbimage shaikmustafa/manual:db

b. docker tag appimage shaikmustafa/manual:app

c. docker push shaikmustafa/manual:db

d. docker push shaikmustafa/manual:app

Deploy ---> Pre-Prod & Prod
post build actions ---> pipeline status

Manual & automatic   

